      "kind": "prose",
      "heading": "What This Service Involves",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "BMW N20 timing chain replacement is a specialist procedure performed in our workshop. The service includes full strip-down access to the front-mounted timing chain, replacement of the chain, guides, and tensioners, and reassembly with precision timing tools. We use genuine or OEM-quality parts, BMW-spec locking tools, and digital torque equipment. After reassembly, we verify VANOS operation and perform compression and leak-down tests to confirm sealing integrity."
        }
      ]
